余者","evidence":["wuhuan-q-857f8ad116646f132245"]},{"person":"wgc-p0014","role":"受遣诣夫余的玄菟太守","evidence":["wuhuan-q-857f8ad116646f132245"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"正始中","precision":"undated","basis":"保留原纪年及粒度；本账户未独立归一公元年，不继承相邻事件年份。","evidence":["wuhuan-q-857f8ad116646f132245"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuhuan-q-857f8ad116646f132245","order":6264},{"id":"wuhuan-e-285a12e365cb4feb2114","title":"位居（大使）遣大加郊迎（王颀），供军粮","accounts":[{"id":"wuhuan-a-285a12e365cb4feb2114","label":"正文","text":"位居（大使）遣大加郊迎（王颀），供军粮","evidence":["wuhuan-q-e89debddd0aa14f47bb0"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wuhuan-p-216e5963973f1a","role":"遣大加迎接并供军粮者","evidence":["wuhuan-q-e89debddd0aa14f47bb0"]},{"person":"wgc-p0014","role":"受迎者","evidence":["wuhuan-q-e89debddd0aa14f47bb0"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"正始中","precision":"undated","basis":"保留原纪年及粒度；本账户未独立归一公元年，不继承相邻事件年份。","evidence":["wuhuan-q-e89debddd0aa14f47bb0"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuhuan-q-e89debddd0aa14f47bb0","order":6265}],"persons":[{"id":"wgc-p0014","name":"王颀","evidence":["wgc-q0015","wgc-q0046","wgc-q0097","wuhuan-q-857f8ad116646f132245","wuhuan-q-e89debddd0aa14f47bb0","wuhuan-q-467915cb77f46a679702"],"aliases":[],"facts":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wgc-m-o018-wgc-p0014","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及王颀","evidence":["wgc-q0015"]},{"id":"wgc-m-o062-wgc-p0014","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及王颀","evidence":["wgc-q0046"]},{"id":"wgc-m-p012-wgc-p0014","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及王颀","evidence":["wgc-q0097"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wgc-q0015","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-d69c99d640aab2056824","layer":"original","quote":"六年〖10〗，复征之，宫遂奔买沟〖11〗。俭遣玄菟太守王颀追之，﹝三﹞过沃沮千有余里〖12〗，至肃慎氏南界〖13〗；刻石纪功，刊丸都之山〖14〗，铭不耐之城〖15〗。诸所诛纳八千余口，论功受赏，侯者百余人。穿山溉灌，民赖其利。迁左将军，假节，监豫州诸军事，领豫州刺史。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":84,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":134,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0046","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-23e8850b8ee57e7e439c","layer":"original","quote":"四年秋，诏诸军征蜀，大将军司马文王皆指授节度。使艾与维相缀连〖2〗，雍州刺史诸葛绪邀维〖3〗：令不得归。艾遣天水太守王颀等直攻维营，陇西太守牵弘等邀其前，金城太守杨欣等诣甘松〖4〗。维闻钟会诸军已入汉中，引退还。欣等追蹑于强川口〖5〗，大战。维败走。闻雍州已塞道〖6〗，屯桥头〖7〗；从孔函谷入北道〖8〗，欲出雍州后。诸葛绪闻之，却还三十里〖9〗。维入北道三十余里，闻绪军却，寻还，从桥头过；绪趋截维，较一日不及〖10〗。维遂东引，还守剑阁〖11〗。钟会攻维未能克。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":322,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":233,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0097","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-6c62127acca3326253cb","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞《世语》曰：“颀字孔硕，东莱人。晋永嘉中，大贼王弥，颀之孙。”","attribution":"世语","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":115,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0ee842eca3e093e2cf96","start":0,"end":34,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0213","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-318a84ef00a413f1b539","layer":"modern","quote":"〖10〗六年：正始六年（公元 245 ）。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":98,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-88ad818e6c0f53570b7f","start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0214","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-d69c99d640aab2056824","layer":"original","quote":"俭遣玄菟太守王颀追之，﹝三﹞过沃沮千有余里〖12〗，至肃慎氏南界〖13〗；刻石纪功，刊丸都之山〖14〗，铭不耐之城","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":84,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":21,"end":78,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0371","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-23e8850b8ee57e7e439c","layer":"original","quote":"艾遣天水太守王颀等直攻维营，陇西太守牵弘等邀其前，金城太守杨欣等诣甘松","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":322,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":52,"end":87,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-467915cb77f46a679702","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-a3a13b352f97b977de34","layer":"original","quote":"王颀别遣追讨宫，尽其东界","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":262,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":74,"end":86,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-857f8ad116646f132245","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-e6e49a573d831a14d039","layer":"original","quote":"遣玄菟太守王颀诣夫余","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":143,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":15,"end":25,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-916e9f026a339b175ccd","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-23465df5bcf6e11b3a0a","layer":"original","quote":"又遣偏师致讨〖15〗，穷追极远；逾乌丸、（骨）〔丸〕都，过沃沮，践肃慎之庭，东临大海","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":114,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":51,"end":93,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-e89debddd0aa14f47bb0","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-e6e49a573d831a14d039","layer":"original","quote":"位居遣大加郊迎，供军粮","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":143,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":26,"end":37,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
